# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your key.
# Get a free Gemini API key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# When set, the AI chat widget + admin AI tools use Google Gemini automatically
# (no need to toggle anything in the admin panel). Leave blank to use the
# built-in offline/simulated assistant.
#
# NOTE: This is a client-side SPA, so this key ships to the browser and is
# visible to end users. Use a key restricted to the Generative Language API
# with tight quotas, or move the call behind a server/proxy for production.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
